        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/f05b48/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-12T15:45:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh, that is just <em>awesome</em>. So I get to redirect the damage back at the Baron, and he hits himself for hitting himself? COOL. It's kinda funny when you think of it thematically: Baron Blade tries to throw a vial of poison at Mr. Fixer, but he somehow knocks it back at the Baron. The vial hits him and breaks, dousing his Backlash Field Generator and causing it to short circuit to hurt him even more. FUN.</p>",
